  "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(release): accept full commit SHA in Windows acceptance evidence by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/297\n* Pianissimo context biasing with the personal dictionary, phase 1 (Refs #298) by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/302\n* Refs #284: diarization finds the right number of speakers on Swedish debates by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/301\n* Fix flaky idle_unload_then_shutdown test by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/307\n* Diarization speaker-count hint (core + CLI), Refs #305 by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/308\n* Private, exclusive temp files for atomic settings/glossary saves by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/317\n* Bound decoder error retries and decoded-byte growth (fixes #311, #312) by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/318\n* Bound model-download bytes and duration (#314) by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/316\n* Show elapsed time and status during meeting transcription by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/321\n* Build native diarization evaluation and evidence workflow by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/330\n* Research: qualify cross-language code-health metrics with explicit limits by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/334\n* Preserve diarization recovery and tighten evaluation contracts by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/333\n* Expose effective diarization decoder settings in CLI progress by @Magnus-Gille in https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/pull/335\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Magnus-Gille/sagascript/compare/v1.4.3...v1.4.4",
